  "sources": [
    {
      "url": "https://www.nps.gov/places/freedom-tower.htm",
      "inspection": "NPS heritage page read:1925 Schultze&Weaver newspaper building, Mediterranean/Spanish and Italian vocabulary, Giralda-derived tower, oak doors/iron transom/balconies/cast ornament. Historic character corroborates local exterior photographs; not used as a current2026finish survey."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://npgallery.nps.gov/GetAsset/587a20e9-1d51-43e1-a906-06657bcb7dd8",
      "sha256": "sha256:beafc7297fbfefc8a90faa98695c0a8a4089f6f04be3298c0db76eaca0dd1ace",
      "inspection": "2008 NHL nomination: read complete relevant pages4,5,8 and inspected rendered pages. East-facing entrance;125ft is property frontage, not a substitute footprint. Basement/lobby about3ft above grade; rear printing wing is relatively plain. Plain tower has corner quoins and three bays; setback crown/balustrades lead to cupola. Restored copper weather vane is19ft tall. Interior rooms and literal sculptural replicas excluded."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://www.skyscrapercenter.com/building/freedom-tower/18895",
      "inspection": "CTBUH/CVU page read:86.3marchitectural/64.9moccupied,17floors. Adopt86.3mnominal overall height and5.7912mvane control; intermediate stage heights remain estimates. Qualla255ft(~77.7m), native whole84.5m and native83mvane differ; record disagreement, do not silently treat255ft as tip height."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://news.mdc.edu/pressrelease/miami-dade-colleges-historic-freedom-tower-to-reopen-in-september-2025-marking-100-years-as-a-symbol-of-hope-and-freedom/",
      "inspection": "Owner2025announcement read: full exterior restoration preserves Mediterranean architecture. Local2007–2018photos provide details; no claim every block/window finish equals2026appearance."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://www.dadeheritagetrust.org/2026/07/08/rj-heisenbottle-architects-m-c-harry-associates-restoration-of-the-freedom-tower/",
      "inspection": "Heritage award issuer record read: facade conservation/cast stone and masonry repairs/copper dome restoration and ornament reconstruction. Linked image actually inspected is award portrait, not exterior, and was rejected as an architectural appearance reference."
    }
  ],
